  "seoTitle": "Polda DIY Detains Four UGM Law Students Over Yogyakarta…",
  "metaDescription": "Polda DIY has detained four UGM law students as part of an investigation into riots following recent demonstrations in Yogyakarta, with one suspect at large.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Polda DIY identified eight suspects involved in the unrest following a demonstration in Yogyakarta.",
    "Four students from the UGM Faculty of Law are currently among those in police detention.",
    "Authorities are continuing their search for one additional suspect who remains at large."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The regional police for the Special Region of Yogyakarta (Polda DIY) have intensified their investigation into disturbances that occurred during recent protest activities. Officials confirmed that eight individuals have been named as suspects in the case, seven of whom are currently in custody. Among those detained are four students from the Faculty of Law at Gadjah Mada University (UGM). One remaining suspect is currently being sought by police, with reports indicating investigators are looking into allegations regarding the creation of explosive materials connected to the unrest. Previously, UGM leadership expressed their opposition to violence and announced intentions to form a fact-finding team to investigate the presence of security personnel on campus during the protests. The legal proceedings remain ongoing as authorities continue their efforts to process the identified suspects.",
